{
  "quest.4083DF14A1871AAD.title": "&6Self Aware",
  "quest.140088E971F70099.title": "&bLeftovers",
  "quest.5550A34C854C3464.quest_desc": [
    "Hunting the same mob a thousand times gets old. The &aSimulation Chamber&r lets a model fight it in a simulation instead.",
    "",
    "Each 15 second run uses one &2Prediction Matrix&r and adds 1 data to the model. Power per tick is the model's simulation cost plus 20%. It refuses Faulty models.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: In this pack the chamber is locked to Training. It never makes items, and it stops once the model is Self Aware. Resources come from the Data Center.",
  ],
  "quest.32AB71D5E3A6819C.quest_desc": [
    "The controller takes power and items on its own, but it sits in the wall with only one face free. &aData Center IO Ports&r let pipes and cables reach in from anywhere on the shell.",
    "",
    "A port replaces any wall or ceiling block. Right-click it to cycle between Energy, Models, Inputs and Outputs. An Outputs port only lets items out.",
  ],
  "quest.1B414139914B5910.quest_desc": [
    "A model in the Data Center does nothing until you tell it what to make.",
    "",
    "Right-click a model's slot to choose its output. Fixed mode makes one drop every cycle, and Queue mode works through a list you build.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The Loot Fabricator is disabled in this pack. The Data Center replaces it.",
  ],
  "quest.4083DF14A1871AAD.quest_desc": [
    "A model's tier sets how much data it needs and how much each kill gives: Basic at 6, Advanced at 54, Superior at 354 and &6Self Aware&r at 1,254.",
    "",
    "Get one model to Self Aware. Mix kills with chamber runs, since a Superior model gains 18 data per kill but only 1 per run.",
    "",
    "Only Self Aware models run in a Data Center, so this is the tier that matters.",
  ],
  "quest.1B414139914B5910.title": "&6Pick Your Loot",
  "quest.140088E971F70099.quest_desc": [
    "Every Data Center cycle also gives a &aGeneralized Prediction&r on top of the drop you picked: Overworld, Nether or End, depending on the model.",
    "",
    "They craft into basics such as Bone, Gunpowder, Iron, Gold, Blaze Rods and Ender Pearls. JEI lists every recipe.",
    "",
    "Overworld Predictions craft with Netherrack into Nether ones, and Nether ones with End Stone into End ones.",
  ],
  "quest.5B16786955266DDD.quest_desc": [
    "&eHostile Neural Networks&r turns fighting and mining into data. Teach a model enough about a mob or an ore and a &2Data Center&r will make its drops for you.",
    "",
    "Craft a &aDeep Learner&r. It holds four &2Data Models&r and records every matching kill or ore broken while it is anywhere in your main inventory, your offhand or a Curios slot.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Hostile Neural Networks\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,ftb:hostile_networks,ftb:index.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Hostile Neural Networks guide\"}}, \" covers the whole loop.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.329FFCF92B62E1FA.title": "&bFood for Thought",
  "quest.63072466EE83CB96.title": "&bAttunement",
  "quest.32AB71D5E3A6819C.title": "&bIO Ports",
  "quest.5B16786955266DDD.title": "&bHostile Neural Networks",
  "quest.2DD3347080DC105A.title": "&6Ore Models",
  "quest.5A610BA53A395CEC.quest_desc": [
    "The &aData Center&r is where models finally pay out. It runs up to 25 Self Aware models at once.",
    "",
    "The shell is 7x7x7. The floor is &2Obsidian&r, the walls and ceiling are &aBlack Stained Glass&r, and the 5x5x5 inside stays empty. The controller replaces one wall block in the first row above the floor and must face out.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each 15 second cycle uses one &2Prediction Matrix&r per model and costs the model's simulation cost plus 25% in power per tick. The controller holds 20,000,000 FE.",
    "",
    "If the shell is wrong, the controller's screen lists the missing blocks and where they go.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Data Center\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,ftb:hostile_networks,ftb:data_center.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Data Center page\"}}, \" has the shell as a 3D view.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.329FFCF92B62E1FA.quest_desc": [
    "Every simulation, in a chamber or a Data Center, uses one &aPrediction Matrix&r.",
    "",
    "One craft makes 16. Keep a stack beside each chamber, and automate the crafting before you build a Data Center, which can use 25 every 15 seconds.",
  ],
  "quest.2E1676FE0AE8E2D3.quest_desc": [
    "Beyond the vanilla mobs, this pack adds models for its own threats: Fire, Ice and Lightning Dragons, the Cyclops, Hydra, Sea Serpent and Troll, the four Mutants, the Ars Magica Guardians, the Demon, the Thunder King and more.",
    "",
    "The Guardian and Elder Guardian models can also make &eNautec&r salvage parts.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Data Models\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,ftb:hostile_networks,ftb:data_models.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Data Models page\"}}, \" lists every model and what it makes.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.63072466EE83CB96.quest_desc": [
    "A &aBlank Data Model&r learns nothing until you point it at something.",
    "",
    "Right-click a mob or an ore block with it to attune it, then put it in the &2Deep Learner&r. A mob or ore with no model ignores the click.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: A new model is Faulty and gains 1 data per kill or ore. It needs 6 to reach Basic, and nothing will simulate it before then.",
  ],
  "quest.2DD3347080DC105A.quest_desc": [
    "Ores have models too. Attune a &2Blank Data Model&r by right-clicking the ore in the world, then mine with the &aDeep Learner&r on you.",
    "",
    "Ore mined with Silk Touch gives no data. The ore's deepslate and other dimension variants count toward the same model.",
    "",
    "40 of the ores that generate in this pack have one. A Self Aware ore model in a Data Center makes that ore's drops.",
  ],
  "quest.5A610BA53A395CEC.title": "&dData Center",
  "quest.5550A34C854C3464.title": "&bSimulation Chamber",
  "quest.2E1676FE0AE8E2D3.title": "&dBigger Prey",
}